content.text:
Title: Enabling & Disabling Popups
Link: https://docs.nosto.com/techdocs/apis/frontend/js-apis/popups/enabling-and-disabling-popups
Content: The following snippet enables the specified popup.

nostojs(api => {
  api.enablePopup("popupCampaignId");
});

toolUseResult.text:
Title: Enabling & Disabling Popups
Link: https://docs.nosto.com/techdocs/apis/frontend/js-apis/popups/enabling-and-disabling-popups
Content: The following snippet enables the specified popup.

nostojs(api => {
  api.enablePopup("popupCampaignId");
});

